#
# `version` must equal concrete_lab.__version__; tests/test_consistency.py
# fails the build otherwise.  Fields that do not exist yet are omitted
# rather than filled with a placeholder: an identifier that reads "soon"
# is not a citation, it is a broken one.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'اگر از این ابزار در پژوهش یا آموزش استفاده می‌کنید، لطفاً به شکل زیر ارجاع دهید.'
title: 'Concrete Lab Companion — پیوست دیجیتال کتاب فناوری بتن در آزمایشگاه'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: 'Mohammadian'
    given-names: 'Behnam'
version: '4.1.0'
date-released: 2026-09-08
url: 'https://github.com/bmhmdyan279-png/Concrete-Lab-Companion'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/bmhmdyan279-png/Concrete-Lab-Companion'
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  A standards-compliant calculation and quality-assurance engine for a concrete
  laboratory. Scientific logic (ASTM C39/C39M-26, ASTM C805/C805M-25, ISIRI 302
  and others) is implemented and golden-case verified in Python; the generated
  Excel workbook is display-only and provably contains no formula cells.
keywords:
  - concrete
  - laboratory
  - excel
  - quality-assurance
  - civil-engineering
  - astm
  - isiri
